[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0010","text":"啊，燕子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0020","text":"……飞得低的时候是要下雨了对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0030","text":"嗯、嗯……呢\n好像会那样来预测天气──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0040","text":"……但是……\n…………今天可能不一样…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0050","text":"啊……原来如此……\n『燕子正在筑巢中』『请注意上方』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0060","text":"是来给雏鸟送食物的呀……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0070","text":"──大家，久等了！我买便当回来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0080","text":"…………呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0090","text":"燕子妈妈，一直以来谢谢你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_03_0100","text":"……嗯？？\n怎、怎么了？"}]
